invariant: INV-16
file: src/aead_avx2.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh aead-avx2
reason: each pass of the seal absorbs the ciphertext of its own pass in
  place of the pass before it, so it reads bytes it has not yet
  encrypted and the tag is wrong for every seal of AEAD_AVX2_MIN bytes or
  more. bin/aead_avx2_equiv_test compares the tag with the two-pass
  AEAD's; the script runs it for x86-64 under qemu-x86_64.

--- old
ct + offset, ct + offset - PASS_BYTES,
--- new
ct + offset, ct + offset,
